  "description": "The egg-shaped, illuminated pod is a visual representation of a futuristic or high-tech setting, often associated with immersive entertainment, gaming arcades, or advanced VR experiences. This environment is not a real-world common occurrence for children but is used here to emphasize the 'over-the-top' or excessive nature of the technology use being criticized. It implies a level of technological immersion that is seen as unnatural or excessive for a child.",
